Emerald 3DS changes to pret/pokeemerald 76463dac15cad36aca5e2b3f6366abf9e53f814f: Korean Frontier banned list
Applies after 0072-korean-follower-texts.patch; apply with tools/bootstrap.py.

Korean build only (GAME_LANGUAGE == LANGUAGE_KOREAN): the list of banned
Pokemon a facility names ("알과 레쿠자는 참가시킬 수 없습니다") ends in the
Korean ROM's gText_Are2, the topic particle with its line break, right after
the last name: the English line break before it put the particle alone in
the next box.

diff --git a/src/frontier_util.c b/src/frontier_util.c
--- a/src/frontier_util.c
+++ b/src/frontier_util.c
@@ -2088,10 +2088,14 @@
         }
         else
         {
+#if GAME_LANGUAGE != LANGUAGE_KOREAN
             if (count & 1)
                 StringAppend(gStringVar1, gText_LineBreak);
             else
                 StringAppend(gStringVar1, gText_Space2);
+#endif
+            // Korean: gText_Are2 is the topic particle and its own line
+            // break, right after the last name ("알과 레쿠자는").
             StringAppend(gStringVar1, gText_Are2);
         }
     }
